((jbofi'e)) - misspelled, unless you are one of a few people who use y'ybu for y'y - in which case you need to at least type your links the normal way so that the can go to extant pages, and so that new pages are in a form MOST people link to.

Notably, jbofihe is also the name of the actual executable program, since, while UNIX allows a __'__ in a filename, the actual typing of it is something of a pain. --((Jay Kominek|jay))
